    <div>
      <h3>Built</h3><p>Optional network features start switched off. Open checks are visible to the whole team. Every figure is computed by code. Smarter search, keyboard shortcuts and sold-out counts on the register. An assistant that can read, and only read, behind the owner’s own login.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>In the works</h3><p>A new look across the iPad, the phone and the handheld, drawn and approved, now being built.</p>
